              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "TLS 1.0 / 1.1: Weak against classical attacks today. Deprecated by RFC 8996."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "TLS 1.0 / 1.1: Weak against classical attacks today. Deprecated by RFC 8996. Recommended replacement: TLS 1.3 (the only version with post-quantum hybrid key exchange)."
